{"id":"automne","lemma":"automne","pos":"noun","rank":2949,"glosses":["autumn, fall"],"ipa":"/o.tɔn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/Fr-automne.ogg/Fr-automne.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"automnes"},"formAudio":{"automnes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-automnes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est l'automne, maintenant.","en":"It's fall now.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"now, currently"}]},{"text":"J'adore l'automne.","en":"I love autumn.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love, to adore","l":"adorer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"En automne, la lune est très belle.","en":"In autumn, the moon is really beautiful.","words":[{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"the Moon"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"}]},{"text":"L'automne commence en octobre.","en":"Autumn begins in October.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"October"}]},{"text":"L'automne fut long et doux.","en":"Autumn was long and mild.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"sweet"}]}]}